  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: EquipmentAltar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: EquipmentAltar
  Prompt: A small dirt trail leads off the road and to a decrepit stone altar. The
    altar is a simple stone table shaped like an anvil, inscribed with runes made
    illegible by years of aging. A large crack runs through the center of the altar.
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: Place something on the altar
    SuccessChance: 0.977
    _successText: Duplicate
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: The runes on the altar begin to glow, and you swear you can see moss
        and dirt recede into the rock. The altar emits a low hum, and for a brief
        moment you see it restored to its former glory. Seconds later, the altar
        shatters and the noise fades. In the pile of ruined stone, you find a massive
        pile of gold.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 12
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
      - Type: 1
        _moneyDelta: 100
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: A sudden explosion of light erupts from the crevices in the stone, igniting
        the altar in a wreath of flames. You watch in horror as some unknown power
        consumes your adventuring gear.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 12
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
  - Text: Speak a short prayer.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
